,{"field":"improved","statement":"Reliance Consumer Products Limited's revenue doubled compared to the previous year, reaching Rs. 8,600 Crores.","quote":"And RCPL continues to do well, and this is at Rs.8,600 Crores is 2x of what it was.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/kavinavora_19072026180618_SE_Transcript.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"improved","statement":"The average revenue per user increased by Rs. 7 year-on-year to reach 215.6.","quote":"ARPU came in at 215.6 that is Rs.7 increase year-on-year. All of this, again, it is without any tariff increases or tariff actions that have happened in the last 12 months.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/kavinavora_19072026180618_SE_Transcript.pdf","page":7.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"deteriorated","statement":"The retail segment's EBITDA decreased slightly compared to the same period last year.","quote":"EBITDA is Rs 6,309 crore, which is slightly lower on a year-on-year basis.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/kavinavora_19072026180618_SE_Transcript.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"deteriorated","statement":"The retail segment's EBITDA margin declined by 80 basis points year-on-year to 7.9%.","quote":"EBITDA margin is at 7.9%. It is down 80 bps on a Y-o-Y basis.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/kavinavora_19072026180618_SE_Transcript.pdf","page":8.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"outlook","statement":"The company expects the ceiling price for gas to increase to $9.9 in the second half of the year.","quote":"But again, we expect this to trend upwards and go towards $9.9 in the second half. That is the outlook.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/kavinavora_19072026180618_SE_Transcript.pdf","page":19.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"outlook","statement":"Power supply from the Kutch renewable project is expected to begin this year once the transmission network is ready.","quote":"And as the transmission network gets ready, we will start supplying power from Kutch this year.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/kavinavora_19072026180618_SE_Transcript.pdf","page":19.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"guidance","statement":"The retail business aims to double its absolute EBITDA over the next three years.","quote":"What we are saying is we are looking to double our absolute EBITDA number.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/kavinavora_19072026180618_SE_Transcript.pdf","page":23.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"guidance","statement":"The company is preparing to execute peak capacities of 55 MWp of solar PV and 150 MWh of battery installations daily.","quote":"We continue to keep preparing for execution at scale, which we have announced at 55 MWp of solar PV per day and 150 MWh of battery installations per day at the peak capacity.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/kavinavora_19072026180618_SE_Transcript.pdf","page":19.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"demand","statement":"High prices and restricted availability severely impacted product demand.","quote":"The demand of products was impacted badly because of multiple reasons. One reason, of course, primary reason was the prices were high.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/kavinavora_19072026180618_SE_Transcript.pdf","page":17.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"demand","statement":"Motor spirit demand growth has been strong due to rising car sales.","quote":"So, MS growth because of car sales have been growing pretty strong. So that has helped in the petrol growing.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/kavinavora_19072026180618_SE_Transcript.pdf","page":15.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"pricing","statement":"The ceiling price for gas realization was lower by nearly $1.14.","quote":"In terms of price realization, yes, the ceiling price is lower by almost $1.14.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/kavinavora_19072026180618_SE_Transcript.pdf","page":18.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"pricing","statement":"Coal bed methane pricing benefited from the absence of a price ceiling, leading to better realizations.","quote":"CBM obviously benefits by not having a price ceiling, so we obviously have realized a lot better in CBM.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/kavinavora_19072026180618_SE_Transcript.pdf","page":18.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"costs","statement":"The production cost of ethylene from naphtha increased significantly.","quote":"The cost of making ethylene from naphtha shot up like anything. That resulted in lot of capacities going under operating in the whole of region within the country also.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/kavinavora_19072026180618_SE_Transcript.pdf","page":17.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"costs","statement":"Investments in technology and dark store infrastructure for online commerce are driving up costs.","quote":"We continue to invest in technology and infrastructure for dark stores to enable online commerce and which is driving the growth in costs.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/kavinavora_19072026180618_SE_Transcript.pdf","page":8.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"costs","statement":"Freight rates from the Middle East increased tenfold compared to typical levels.","quote":"Then we also had the freight rate, which probably was a 10x against typically a dollar or so from the Middle East, we saw actually rise to 10 times that price.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/kavinavora_19072026180618_SE_Transcript.pdf","page":13.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"ma